  "question": "Which restaurant is nearest along the route connecting Oak Grove Football Stadium, Bessemer, AL to UAB Freestanding ER, Gardendale, AL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.156715 33.468802)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.819206 33.648997)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.156715 33.468802)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.156715 33.468802)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
